Adaptation 08-codex-substitutes-not-opus

Added here, not in the fork. Adaptation 07 runs a value that resolves to an Opus model at
`medium`, "whatever that line or a platform mapping says". On Codex a reader sometimes applied
that rule to a Claude alias that the Codex mapping substitutes with a non-Opus model, and ran
the substitute at `medium`. The Codex mapping now says its substitutes are not Opus models, so
each role runs at the level the mapping lists.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

diff --git a/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md b/poteto-mode/references/codex-tools.md
